WEBVTT

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:19.630
Beneath the leaves, beneath the stone,

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.910
There's a world we've barely known.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.910
No voice to hear, no light to see,

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:35.550
Just a little trace of mystery.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.890
Down in the soil where the old roots grow,

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:57.170
There's something changing, moving slow.

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.770
A little rise, a little fall,

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.870
We keep on watching through it all.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:07.300
Oh, tell me what you've found down there.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.220
Just a signal in the ground.

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:11.240
And do you know what it means?

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:15.240
Not yet, but we're still around.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:20.840
When the data flows...

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.180
Oh, let it flow...

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:26.610
Through the silence down below.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:30.470
Every signal, every line,

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:33.640
Leaves a footprint there in time.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.530
When the data flows...

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.610
Where the hidden networks grow...

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:41.070
We don't claim to understand,

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:45.070
We're just listening to the land.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:08.180
The rain comes down, the seasons turn,

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:11.030
There's still so much we've got to learn.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:14.680
Some days quiet, some days strange,

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:18.560
So many reasons things can change.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.300
Could be the weather, could be the ground.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:24.300
Could be a hundred things around.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.870
So we measure, night and day.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:31.870
And let the evidence lead the way.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.140
When the data flows...

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:37.150
Oh, let it flow...

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:40.560
Through the silence down below.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.330
Every signal, every line,

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.390
Leaves a footprint there in time.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.230
When the data flows...

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.540
Through the networks no one knows...

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.980
We don't claim to understand,

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.980
We're just listening to the land.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:38.110
Not every spike is a message.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.810
Not every pattern is a sign.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:46.810
Sometimes the hardest thing to learn...

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.410
Is knowing where to draw the line.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.670
And if the answers never come...

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:56.260
The measurements will still go on.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:00.260
Some questions take a lifetime.

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.290
Some roads are mighty long.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:05.740
When the data flows...

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.495
Oh, let it flow...

00:04:07.495 --> 00:04:09.250
There's a world we want to know.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.910
Every season, every day,

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:16.210
Brings another trace our way.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.780
When the data flows...

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.390
And the quiet current grows...

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:24.020
We will follow where it leads,

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:28.020
Through the roots beneath the trees.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.230
No promises of what we'll find...

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:39.230
Just open eyes and an open mind...

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.310
When the data flows...

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.790
We listen.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:51.790
Listen to the Forest.
